Depends: R (>= 4.5)
Description: The package supports (1) BB-Cox (Bayesian Bootstrap Cox Model), (2) BB-CRR (Bayesian Bootstrap Competing Risks Regression), (3) BB-KM (Bayesian Bootstrap Kaplan-Meier), (4) BB-GLM (Bayesian Bootstrap Generalised Linear Model: currently only available for binary outcome, i.e., Logistic Model).
